Independent research software inspired by the document-structure retrieval direction in
STAIR (STructure Aware Information Retriever), Kumar et al., arXiv:2609.03874v2 (2026).
Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official implementation of IBM or the authors.
No STAIR source code, model weights, book corpus or SearchTome data is bundled.

The public-docs-v1 evaluation corpus includes unmodified public FastAPI and HTTPX
documentation under their respective MIT and BSD-3-Clause licenses. Complete notices,
source commits and content hashes are in datasets/public-docs-v1. Original dataset
annotations remain Apache-2.0 and are explicitly marked as requiring independent review.
